The intention of this page is to provide a list of instances of usages or proposals that violate the baseline yet are not accidental errors.

The list may possibly serve to indicate how much or how little baseline violation is going on, and will provide a forum for the opponents of baseline violation to issue specific rather than generalized anathemata.

--((And))

